ong\",\n        \"depthWrite\": true,\n        \"DbgColor\": 15658734,\n        \"transparent\": false,\n        \"blending\": \"NormalBlending\",\n        \"DbgName\": \"base\"\n    }\n```\n\nexported by **old** blender exporter:\n\n```\n{\n        \"DbgColor\" : 15658734,\n        \"DbgIndex\" : 0,\n        \"DbgName\" : \"base\",\n        \"blending\" : \"NormalBlending\",\n        \"colorDiffuse\" : [0.8353104591369629, 0.9113926887512207, 0.8539685010910034],\n        \"colorSpecular\" : [0.24736842513084412, 0.24736842513084412, 0.24736842513084412],\n        \"depthTest\" : true,\n        \"depthWrite\" : true,\n        \"shading\" : \"Lambert\",\n        \"specularCoef\" : 50,\n        \"opacity\" : 1.0,\n        \"transparent\" : false,\n        \"vertexColors\" : false\n    }\n```\n\nWith regards to the new exporter settings , everything is set to default except for the Face Materials option, in Shading section.  \n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/7962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/7962/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]